  "matrix_note": "tests/prod/309 runs these scenarios over every row and derives each expected state from the row. A scanner whose semantics differ declares that here rather than in a copied test body. tests/prod/308 proves the shared lifecycle mechanics once; 309 proves only that each adapter participates in that lifecycle and honours its own contract row."
